Package: runAnalysisLocally
Title: Run MMC 4Mi Analyses Locally from a Dataset and a List of Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Abubakar", "Athman", , "abubakar.athman@mixedmigration.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mixed Migration Centre", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: The Analysis Kit workflow as a package. Reads a research dataset
    and a List of Analysis (LoA) workbook, validates the two against each
    other, runs the requested proportions, means, medians, ratios, selection
    counts and choice combinations across every disaggregation, and writes the
    results to an MMC-branded Excel workbook. The analysis engine, the LoA
    reader and the exporter are the same code the Analysis Kit Shiny
    application uses, exposed as ordinary functions so a run can be scripted,
    scheduled or repeated without an interface.
